857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804938","source_hash":"52953d588ff0d52192fb1d831e69ab0917ff7c7a9e5009302e0ab243c3455239","text":"提供传统花圈或盆栽植物，或向宾客赠送礼物"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00040","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804939","source_hash":"2703e116a50d1acb5ae1f5c770709979311ebdb3d4db0a030b0c74acda576869","text":"4. 教育活动 · 鼓励和支持灾民及教育弱势群体"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00041","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804940","source_hash":"314c7e1db39480f8aed0cf9a708cbba9a97b541724f32efae92b96bfb75cafda","text":"a. 如果因校园暴力造成的事故发生在相关地方教育行政机构的管辖范围内，或者"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00042","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804941","source_hash":"50686804ca51a38eb4cadb4a826019032caad6934d81aab7868f3bb05a21c754","text":"若在教育活动中发生意外事故，将向受害者及其家属提供经济和物质援助。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00043","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804942","source_hash":"492d012d815a75903fa651ce4d1b119038c307f1b4c80fae7c01c304e01e7829","text":"餐食及提供的餐食"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00044","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804943","source_hash":"2db0c42887bb390a1b1920dcfe4455836947d6147b577599231b8a1469be2006","text":"b. 如果在相关地方教育行政机构管辖范围内发生灾害或事故，灾害受害者，"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00045","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804944","source_hash":"4c191b345e79c336e81553180be9c8a5aa6485110e19c1e72aa79831a6977196","text":"向受害者、遇难者家属、灾后重建工作人员等提供慰问金、礼物和餐食。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00046","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804945","source_hash":"9575d098ac659c8d2c77828d9318da63491057feaf797f73bba716340f30d321","text":"提供"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00047","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804946","source_hash":"8c3c2a32b0969c7e91bb9c96149fe25d652148ed00d2c9543afb274438d1a3e9","text":"。在相关地方教育行政机关的管辖范围内，依据《公职选举法》第一百一十二条第二款第三项规定，编号为"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00048","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804948","source_hash":"6b31afce643e9ff13dd24c629dd68b023b43d4b8c75d60431ed64d63dc1ce761","text":". 与教育相关的灾害或事故发生在相关地方教育行政机构管辖范围之外的区域。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00049","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804949","source_hash":"ebedd5244a7a332510757f2d73dafeab41c3af7d2b76cfeedc534ea342b46be7","text":"如果发生这种情况，应向灾害受害者或受灾民众提供鼓励资金、物资和膳食。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00050","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804950","source_hash":"70cf17c820db269cf797fa76f034583ccaa9a1b569a91f7f68a5bc8492c8cc78","text":"5. 政策或本地促销"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00051","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804951","source_hash":"b6dfee3875b176c8752be0fb8b32f35450358c57aac791d392827d31471142f9","text":"a. 与媒体代表会面，宣传相关地方教育行政机构的政策项目"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00052","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804952","source_hash":"ff8b68506b3a7c8e4e04555097be75b8fb0b984a28f31f30d98f4fa41e9c32eb","text":"主办方提供的餐食 START"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00053","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804953","source_hash":"2b029669901c3bc1fbba923ba0c6325794423f9dc5324f0dd6bf980798259e36","text":"b. 根据与其他机构或组织以及相关方的协议仪式，赠送或交换纪念礼品"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00054","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804954","source_hash":"40d1766d2bfedde228fc51fa0cc8bed171e7a45e061f61dc10f1b27b519040cb","text":"餐食供应"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00055","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804955","source_hash":"0bc2e773fc9810552291f3fce32406e8ccc47755d208d91c78e6ed904e7c00e4","text":"这是向来访者（不包括一般请愿者）提供礼仪性礼物。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00056","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804956","source_hash":"1ff3db9f938a410c7aa6817e3f65581a0bcfbcb3ae9a34a606e74aa6db950c40","text":"。为了推广相关的本地特色产品，媒体代表应具备一定的专业水平。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00057","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804957","source_hash":"bfe3c83f5b2c60a990630da39dbb72651bf5a202644bb2284df79c1a1f050b3a","text":"产品提供"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00058","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804958","source_hash":"4de18f4b289885280ff8937e67f2cb7849bf56e7e68fa331df503c398cbb8f00","text":"6. 鼓励和支持现场部门员工"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00059","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804959","source_hash":"a910200c9d32b17fae9612a074ea05efffbd1f8ae6e90cc0813536a180153b3d","text":"a. 发生在相关地方教育行政机构管辖范围内的与教育和学术事务有关的集体民事投诉"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00060","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804960","source_hash":"895c0ffbfa1a2e749c9f4ebd92af570f9bf587cd6464aac238c2f1d0d66b4225","text":"向相关各方（包括因示威活动而留在现场的工人等）提供鼓励性资金和物资。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00061","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804961","source_hash":"6250afe7ce1765dd9c52b48bfc2ddd797b5ac946c434de58016f92c00aa9a620","text":"付款和餐食已提供"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00062","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804962","source_hash":"9475a6e567da5ab924a37e7260506fed4fa704fff7bdd91f99f262c3aa1a546c","text":"b. 在相关地方教育行政机构的管辖范围内举办公共活动的情况下，"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00063","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804963","source_hash":"9902ac3766f9a69aebf02af944b6824baf17980af63e5213412750e5f29b0ddf","text":"派出所（包括派出所等）和消防部门从事消防、交通管制、维护公共秩序和引导秩序等工作。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00064","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804964","source_hash":"19056360e5c4cf0c66f4c72114bdbedc31604cd0561513beb3a0a54c533634a4","text":"鼓励相关机构（如警察局（包括派出所）、军事单位或学校）的现场工作人员参与。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00065","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804965","source_hash":"7ed409edb0035ce0e3f3a5d9d27f835ded08b3a7dddde1c4205070dc89e8a1fc","text":"支付金钱和贵重物品以及提供膳食"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00066","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804966","source_hash":"97507e16c569ae6e877b939649ff524f05167aeb72df245f1dd128eb8ca203ad","text":"。军事单位、防暴警察、消防站（包括分局）、派出所（包括区派出所等）、邮局、"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00067","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804967","source_hash":"2a9698506c891fe023ce684094ff46529039f1a4f69ebc5be3d6e4a2bdcbb439","text":"目前在国家机构、地方政府和其他地方教育行政机构工作的雇员（现）"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00068","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804968","source_hash":"624a07e1d9bef08c3565634e76aaff71c09ce8d710b925df634f1483c3ff03d1","text":"部分）向相关机构代表支付奖金和礼品，以造福员工"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00069","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804969","source_hash":"feccf86fdf3553a5dcee259dd21421e667b812456a521911391f0c81d070694d","text":"7. 鼓励和支持附属全职员工"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00070","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804970","source_hash":"e4f47867d3be1c85ec7ede3e6c87e7d02f10fd258cd6c04ff9548bf71add938c","text":"a. 相关地方教育行政机构的全职员工（直属机构和下属教育行政机构的员工以及"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00071","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804971","source_hash":"e1890983644fe15cfb3f75843fa0f35e1feb937b8cab05d73a4e869233d47f12","text":"（包括各级学校的教职员工。本款下文亦适用此规定）如果他们受伤或"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00072","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804972","source_hash":"43aadcdb10e608227b233f463ae87373efceab1af7bf2a6227567e89432acb44","text":"死亡发生时，向死者家属支付慰问金和物品"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00073","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804973","source_hash":"81e0523a5ca8c66ebf25d27c39a028b7c8b4732ee69e47b8603ea28239f826b1","text":"B. 向做出重大贡献的退休全职员工支付奖励金和礼品"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00074","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804974","source_hash":"6a2b25b65e9245479c59e4c19404f379be9146b2ce592e8f10a12475129ca2c6","text":"。在国家级或地方教育行政机关级的附属全职员工或部门中，"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00075","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804975","source_hash":"e1020c337203d26d2b62ad4736b74372f1ad9f20468255dd13f18afd05055ae7","text":"在评估和比赛中取得优异成绩的人员，或与相关部门  有关的人员"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00076","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804976","source_hash":"77cec7a2eae7922b6fa49d7d044e6f19dd5bbd1218b4c388dd3afa2f3114b6a0","text":"付款和货物"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00077","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804977","source_hash":"c0c041b4a61ac7fec1cce37f16b3ca02688b92c33c156ab6e4973dee97478654","text":"d. 在设施管理、安保、卫生、环境清洁、烹饪或驾驶等相关全职员工中。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00078","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804978","source_hash":"7f5c6b9b9915ef105a4cf00171071da0a60a1738afa4d0886644850fd62cf4ec","text":"向现场工作人员支付奖励和福利"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00079","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804979","source_hash":"2756a1690430ab1d84d666a53faeeeb4486c37d6f730287467890643a12aa575","text":"E. 提供膳食以鼓励附属全职员工辛勤履行职责"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00080","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804980","source_hash":"7db2c91de171f11f5cc44e3afef21c48820c5322d851fca04c2a8aa52d7e109f","text":"B. 在附属全职员工中，因灾害、灾难、事故等而执行紧急任务的公职人员。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00081","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804981","source_hash":"f2dd7f1a2d045853e3ce0d6dbfb2f996370061771004597383aed5e70e2f9221","text":"为[该公司]提供奖励金和餐食"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00082","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804982","source_hash":"e3dfcd38ad047fdd6a1862461ae410e54a68f4ffbaea6ef1df3dd6626cd48e05","text":"d. 相关地方教育行政机构的负责人或高级公职人员，在管辖区域内"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00083","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804983","source_hash":"3cf0551b8084c964b7c9e34874bd15cf6ff2b84afde21b8629728a9bbca55a83","text":"在走访各级政府机关和学校时，应向该机构的专职工作人员办理业务。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00084","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804984","source_hash":"ae49dc8335e544c22eede4086c609e45e4221ed28edbd2a00fb7f032fa147541","text":"提供奖励金、礼品和餐食以鼓励[韩国]"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00085","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804985","source_hash":"5b3bd78d36c46c86c4d60692555950ee49d148e7d42c1bf36524d184e4f730b0","text":"A. 附属全职员工（不包括各级学校的教职员工）和下级机构（各级学校"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00086","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804986","source_hash":"a1708845c48eeaaf7c289411c68bb4e26e3fd3f679995b134363a52e16e810bc","text":"致代表（不包括）其本人年末、农历新年、中秋节或其生日的计划和预算"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00087","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804988","source_hash":"62fc27ca41518fa6bd9d02c624a5e16a36e794c42ce25bab26fb750c24347789","text":"8. 与履行职责相关的日常费用"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00088","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804989","source_hash":"ce60b86e187ab77767e6721b160f9b804cbe4b66f17e08084f5a333c2347cc23","text":"a. 为游客购买饮料和小吃原料"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00089","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804990","source_hash":"4b990a5ae83dd22fdbbb8321998b66ee2ae57f09c2ac2be222fefbe68fb15d8e","text":"B. 祝贺和慰问的现金和礼品"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00090","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804991","source_hash":"3e7a9bd96e37839228a4c3b7ef8052b3c62d2185e04b643ce4e9f19e22f6dfa7","text":"1) 资格范围：结婚或死亡"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00091","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804992","source_hash":"8963326d14492457273d142849f4a28c84eb52dfa4b167f3dd2066a3dc0532b7","text":"2) 合格受益人：受益人本人及其配偶，以及其直系祖先和后代"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00092","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804993","source_hash":"e99ef33341b0217894539dfa8cd236ae1bc9e8fa2d9881ec8bd6ebb5505da094","text":"3) 按付款方对收款人进行分类"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00093","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804994","source_hash":"327d466d5674b8c016653728be494169ff9a43b9f76654f7c83f4c844a42b9ec","text":"a) 教育总监或符合《公职选举法》第113条第1款规定的候选人（候选人）"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00094","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804995","source_hash":"205b618be01ba6b7a5236689c5cef6ec10cfa3e553a5371964cbc11e2c993377","text":"的人）的名义进行的，则适用"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00095","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804996","source_hash":"e1509686cdf789dbe90f484e43e5b7a8b4b3fe4ce56ae099a5c94a0adb773fe7","text":"全职员工（仅适用于总部工作人员或附属下级机构的代表，）"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00096","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804997","source_hash":"f8a55e11ffde3306607d82147b78cb6d05b3ba015534f2e0f14145d943185c89","text":"（不包括各级学校的教职员工）"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00097","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804998","source_hash":"00efb75cf061fe23c3eed6251560364665fe97e943ef48497add972629dfa420","text":"b) 除a) 情况外，以属于相关地方教育行政机构的公职人员名义支付款项的情况。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00098","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2804999","source_hash":"2928935d514de813890321a60ef8b42e8be2dc1b40525a6051436dd0029460bb","text":"全职员工（仅适用于总部、教育办公室及直接附属机构的员工）"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00099","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2805000","source_hash":"fab29fa53f06b34b64b28fdd6ddfec069e8ba77f00e4858109f9ed42b6a3c1be","text":"- 相关地方议会成员"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00100","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2805001","source_hash":"c83d8ec74e72c2c056950969b3821ee1090acf86867d7c93cfb2b39988a77cbb","text":"- 相关地方教育行政机构管辖范围内与商业活动相关的机构员工"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00101","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2805002","source_hash":"dda7f918248d2d0e346b90ae0c01d0ce897dafbef7f3dda406e90dd7dd7f256d","text":"9. 其他有关地方教育行政机关履行职责的事项，例如科目、方法、范围等。"},{"id":"A38350-zh-00102","doc":"A38350","law_id":"kr-013102-202857-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2805003","source_hash"